---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-navy-800 text-navy-200 mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">SeniorHomeViolations.com</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Independent safety grades and violation tracking for nursing homes across the United States. Helping families make informed care decisions.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Quick Links</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#states" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Browse by State</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#search" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Search Facilities</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Data Source</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          All inspection, citation, and penalty data is sourced from publicly available records published by the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (CMS), U.S. Department of Health and Human Services.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-navy-600 pt-6">
      <p class="text-xs text-navy-300 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Legal Disclaimer:</strong> The information on this website is compiled from public government records made available by the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (CMS). Safety grades are algorithmically calculated based on publicly available inspection, citation, penalty, and staffing data and represent an independent editorial assessment. This site is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by CMS or any government agency. While we strive for accuracy, data may contain errors or may not reflect the most current status of a facility. This information should not be the sole basis for choosing a care facility. Always visit facilities in person and consult with healthcare professionals before making care decisions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-navy-400 mt-4">&copy; {year} SeniorHomeViolations.com. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
